Package: StructuralModelTester
Title: Visual Structural Model Tester
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Baptiste", email = "baptiste@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Jamovi-inspired Shiny interface for defining structural models,
    mapping data to nodes, and testing links with p-values or AIC/BIC model search
    using lavaan.
